# =====================================================================
# Release V071 -- Recall KPIs scoped to active patients
# =====================================================================
# Overdue Recalls + Retention Outlook were including inactive patients.
# Fact_Recalls now requires Dim_Patients.Active=1 in Is_In_Scope and
# Retention_Outlook_In_Scope, so both cards (which read those flags via
# Fact_KPI_Snapshot / Fact_Metric_Actuals) become active-scoped.
#
# Rebuild order after deploy: Fact_Recalls -> Fact_KPI_Snapshot -> Fact_Metric_Actuals
# -> model (a normal Orchestrate_Build covers it).
#
# Run: .\Scripts\Deploy.ps1 -Manifest Releases\V071__recalls_active_scope.manifest -SkipTests
# =====================================================================

DEPLOY  Fabric\Gold.usp_Load_Fact_Recalls.StoredProcedure.sql

TEST
